WEBVTT

00:29:59.270 --> 00:30:02.726
and also feeling like
it's sort of out of their hands,

00:30:02.750 --> 00:30:06.206
whether the patient
leaves feeling cared for

00:30:06.230 --> 00:30:08.440
and satisfied and helped.

00:30:08.464 --> 00:30:10.878
By expressing concern

00:30:10.902 --> 00:30:13.326
and doing that in a way
that the patient hears it.

00:30:13.350 --> 00:30:14.970
AB: I think you're spot-on.

00:30:14.994 --> 00:30:16.996
That is the magic.

00:30:17.020 --> 00:30:20.258
And you see the clinicians
sort of go, "Oh."

00:30:20.703 --> 00:30:23.035
(Laughs)

00:30:24.260 --> 00:30:26.466
You're making it easier.

00:30:26.490 --> 00:30:30.420
You're literally teaching
the clinician, or the doc,